Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Recommends: default-mysql-client
Description: Snort unified2 output spooler with database support
 Barnyard2 reads the binary unified2 event files written by Snort and
 forwards the events to one or more output plugins, so that the sensor
 itself is not blocked on database or network I/O.
 .
 This build enables the MySQL output plugin, which is what Snorby and
 comparable consoles read from, and works with unified2 files produced by
 either Snort 2 or Snort 3.
